  maxHealth: 440
  contactDamage: 2
  scoreReward: 24000
  description: The book the host reads before it falls. Nobody wrote it. It accumulates
    - and the loose pages are looking for somewhere to file you.
  tactics: 'The rift endgame (difficulty 8, 1000 HP): crosses through curtains, then
    rift homing volleys over a spiral with Hexblade adds, and in the Last Word -
    dense rift rings, rift gyres, homing bolts, and a DIREHOUND MINIBOSS summoned
    into the fight. Bring full buffs, read every square, and never fight the hound
    inside a ring eruption.'
